---
import Service from '../../../layouts/Service.astro'
import { images } from '../../../data/images'

const img = images.zakelijkHero
---

<Service
  locale="en"
  path="/en/commercial/"
  altPath="/zakelijk/"
  title="Commercial Cleaning Company Hoofddorp | DSC Living"
  description="Offices, gyms, clinics and retail units. Daily presentation, inspection coordination and repairs under one contract with one invoice."
  serviceType="Commercial property services"
  h1="Cleaning and management of commercial property"
  lead="An office, gym or clinic is judged before anyone says a word. We keep commercial property in the state your visitors expect, and make sure the routines behind that — inspections, records, small repairs — never become anyone's Friday-afternoon problem."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/en/' }, { label: 'Commercial' }]}
  heroImage={{ src: img.src, alt: img.alt, note: img.note }}
  ctaLabel="Book a walkthrough"
>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3 mt-10 mb-10">
    <div>
      <h2 class="h3 mb-2">One contract for the whole building.</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        Daily or weekly presentation, periodic deeper work, repairs and the coordination of
        certified inspections, under one agreement with one invoice.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="h3 mb-2">Outside opening hours where needed.</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">Work scheduled around your opening hours instead of straight through them.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="h3 mb-2">Records you can produce.</h2>
      <p class="body-copy">
        Every visit is logged on the job sheet and every coordinated inspection archived, so the
        answer is already on paper when a landlord, insurer or inspector asks for it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="h2 mt-10 mb-4">Sectors we work with</h2>
  <p class="body-copy mb-4">
    Offices, gyms, clinics and retail units — properties where the first impression counts
    immediately. For <a href="/en/commercial/office-cleaning/" class="text-accent hover:underline">office cleaning</a> and
    <a href="/en/commercial/gym-cleaning/" class="text-accent hover:underline">gym cleaning</a> we
    run separate, sector-specific job sheets; the underlying setup — one contract, one invoice —
    stays the same across sectors.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h2 mt-10 mb-4">What a commercial agreement covers</h2>
  <p class="body-copy mb-4">
    Cleaning to a job sheet you set, periodic deeper work such as floors and glazing, small
    repairs so a fault doesn't sit for weeks, and coordination of mandatory inspections. All under
    one point of contact, so you're not switching between suppliers yourself.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h2 mt-10 mb-4">Inspections we coordinate</h2>
  <p class="body-copy mb-4">
    Fire safety, electrics, lifts where applicable — we hold the calendar, make sure the right
    certified firm attends, and archive the certificate. We don't carry out these inspections
    ourselves; that's done by the firms certified to. Our role is coordination and evidence, not
    the inspection itself.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h2 mt-10 mb-4">Rates</h2>
  <p class="body-copy mb-4">
    Price depends on the type of property, its size and the frequency you want, so we don't work
    from a flat upfront rate. After a free walkthrough you receive a written proposal within two
    working days, with scope and frequency clearly broken out.
  </p>

  <h2 class="h2 mt-10 mb-4">Book a walkthrough</h2>
  <p class="body-copy">
    A walkthrough of your building costs nothing and commits you to nothing. We look at the
    spaces, discuss what's already working well and what needs attention, then send a proposal
    you can adjust at any point.
  </p>
</Service>
